# splat-project

Upload photos of an object or scene, reconstruct it as a 3D Gaussian Splat, view it in-browser.

Built on top of gsplat's rasterization kernel; everything else (Gaussian
representation, camera math, training loop, densification, post-training
compression) is implemented from scratch.

## Project layout
- `src/splatproj/data` — COLMAP output parsing, dataset loading
- `src/splatproj/camera` — camera intrinsics/extrinsics, projection math
- `src/splatproj/model` — Gaussian parameters, rasterization wrapper
- `src/splatproj/training` — training loop, adaptive density control
- `src/splatproj/compression` — post-training quantization/pruning
- `src/splatproj/api` — FastAPI backend, Claude-generated scene reports